        "original_id": "1fb9b3c6-cca6-5d0b-8e9e-dbd032b64233",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Belgium, Italy\n- Events: Brabant massacres, Years of Lead, Bloody Eighties, Cold War\n- Organizations: Westland New Post, NATO\n- Operations: Operation Gladio\n\nFacts:\n- In Belgium, the term \"années de plomb\" or \"Bloody Eighties\" refers to the Brabant massacres.\n- The Brabant massacres resulted in 28 deaths.\n- Westland New Post, a far-right movement, has been suspected in the Brabant massacres campaign.\n- During the Cold War, Operation Gladio was the codename for a clandestine NATO \"stay-behind\" operation in Italy.",
